---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { formatAddress, site } from "../config/site";
---

<BaseLayout page="privacy">
  <article class="prose-page mx-auto px-4 py-10 md:px-6 md:py-16">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-navy-muted">Plain English. UK GDPR. Last updated 20 August 2026.</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      {site.legalName} (company number {site.companyNumber}) trades as {site.name}. We run an indoor adventure play café at {formatAddress()}.
    </p>
    <p>
      To contact us about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a> or the form on the <a class="font-bold underline underline-offset-2" href="/contact">contact page</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect, and why</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Enquiry forms</strong> (contact and party): name, email, optional phone, and whatever you write. We use this to reply. Legal basis: legitimate interests, or taking steps at your request before a contract.</li>
      <li><strong>Bookings</strong> are taken by Bookwhen, with payments by Stripe. Their systems collect the details needed to book and pay. We see booking information in order to run the session. Legal basis: contract.</li>
      <li><strong>SEND adjustments</strong> you tell us about are special category data if they include health information. We only keep what we need to make the visit work, and we do not use it for anything else.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
    <p>
      Hosting is on Netlify. Forms submitted on this site are processed by Netlify so they reach us. Bookings and payments are processed by Bookwhen and Stripe. We do not sell your information. We do not use advertising networks.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This website does not set analytics or marketing cookies. We have not added a consent banner because we are not asking to track you. Hosting and form submission may use strictly necessary cookies to keep the site secure and to send your message. If we ever add optional analytics, we will put a proper notice up first.
    </p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>
      Enquiry messages: as long as needed to deal with them, then deleted. Booking records: as long as needed to run the business, meet accounting rules, and handle genuine queries or incidents.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask for a copy of your information, ask us to correct it, delete it, or restrict how we use it, and you can object to processing based on legitimate interests. To do that, use the contact form. You can complain to the Information Commissioner’s Office at <a class="font-bold underline underline-offset-2" href="https://ico.org.uk">ico.org.uk</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      This site is for adults booking for children. We do not knowingly collect information directly from children through the website.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
